Lady Elaydren d'Cannith is a member of House Cannith's Breland enclave who serves as a patron and information source for adventurers working on Cannith-related matters.

She carries the Mark of Making and is deeply invested in recovering lost Cannith creation schemas from the time before the [[Mourning]]. Her position within the house is precarious — she operates semi-independently, walking a line between the three post-Mourning Cannith factions (Cannith South, Cannith East, Cannith West).

Elaydren is pragmatic, well-informed, and willing to pay generously for results. She prefers to work through intermediaries to maintain deniability.

!! Role in the Whisper Campaign
Elaydren has hired agents multiple times to recover warforged-related artifacts. She has particular interest in a specific Creation Pattern rumored to be hidden somewhere in the vaults beneath [[Sharn]].

